  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development, by reason of its poor configuration as evidenced by Bedroom 1 not being served by any external fenestration would give rise to a substandard form of accommodation with occupants of this bedroom not being provided with natural light, outlook and ventilation, to the detriment of their overall living conditions. The development is thereby contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP 4 and CP 30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD 5, DMD 6 and DMD 8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), in addition to the London Housing Design Standards LPG (2023)."
